0	section	Talking to Captain Lawgof after fixing the railings
1	line	Captain Lawgof	Well done, trooper! The goblins seems to have stopped getting in. I think you've done the job!
1	line	Player	Great, I'll be getting on then.
1	line	Captain Lawgof	What? I'll have you jailed for desertion!
1	line	Captain Lawgof	Besides, I have another commission for you. Just before the goblins over-ran us we lost contact with our watch tower to the South, that's why the goblins managed to catch us unawares. I'd like you to perform
1	line	Captain Lawgof	a covert operation into enemy territory, to check up on the guards we have stationed there.
1	line	Captain Lawgof	They should have reported in by now ...
1	line	Player	Okay, I'll see what I can find out.
1	line	Captain Lawgof	Excellent! I have two men there, the dwarf-in-charge is called Gilob, find him and tell him that I'll send him a relief guard just as soon as we mop up these remaining goblins.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Captain Lawgof again without visiting the watchtower
