0	section	Talking to Captain Lawgof before fixing the cannon
1	line	Captain Lawgof	How are you doing in there, trooper? We've been trying our best with that thing, but I just haven't got the patience.
1	line	Player	It's not an easy job, but I'm getting there.
1	line	Captain Lawgof	Good stuff, let me know if you have any luck. If we manage to get that thing working, those goblins will be no trouble at all.
1	cond	If the player lost the toolkit:
2	line	Player	I'm afraid I lost the toolkit...
