1	line	Captain Lawgof	What do you think you're doing, trooper! Did I give you orders to move that cannon? No! Well then don't!
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Captain Lawgof after fixing the cannon
1	line	Player	Hello again.
1	line	Captain Lawgof	Hello there trooper, how's things?
1	line	Player	Well, I think I've done it, take a look...
1	line	Captain Lawgof	That's fantastic, well done!
1	line	Captain Lawgof	Well I don't believe it, it seems to be working perfectly! I seem to have underestimated you, trooper!
1	line	Player	Not bad for an adventurer eh?
1	line	Captain Lawgof	Not bad at all, your effort is appreciated, my friend. Now, if I could figure what the thing uses as ammo...
1	line	Captain Lawgof	The Black Guard forgot to send instructions. I know I said that was the last favour, but...
1	line	Player	What now?
1	line	Captain Lawgof	I can't leave this post, could you go to the Black Guard base and find out what this thing actually shoots?
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Sorry, I've really done enough.
2	line	Player	Sorry, I've really done enough.
2	line	Captain Lawgof	Fair enough, fair enough.
2	action	end
1	option	Okay then, just for you!
2	line	Player	Okay then, just for you!
2	line	Captain Lawgof	That's great, we were lucky you came along when you did. The base is located just South of the Ice Mountain.
2	line	Captain Lawgof	You'll need to speak to Nulodion, the Dwarf Cannon engineer. He's the Weapons Development Chief for the Black Guard, so if anyone knows how to fire this thing, it'll be him.
2	line	Player	Okay, I'll see what I can do.
2	action	end
