1	line	Player	Hello there.
1	line	Nulodion	Can I help you?
1	line	Player	Captain Lawgof sent me. He's having trouble with his cannon.
1	line	Nulodion	Of course, we forgot to send the ammo mould!
1	line	Player	It fires mould?
1	line	Nulodion	Don't be silly - the ammo's made by using a mould. Here, take these to him. The instructions explain everything.
