0	section	Talking to Lawgof after getting the ammo mould
1	line	Player	Hi.
1	line	Captain Lawgof	Hello trooper, any word from the Cannon Engineer?
1	line	Player	Yes, I have spoken to him.
1	cond	If the player does not have the notes and ammo mould:
