1	line	Player	He gave me an ammo mould and some notes to give to you...
1	line	Captain Lawgof	Aah, of course, we make the ammo! This is great, now we will be able to defend ourselves. I don't know how to thank you...
1	line	Player	You could give me a cannon...
1	line	Captain Lawgof	Hah! You'd be lucky, those things are worth a fortune.
1	line	Captain Lawgof	I'll tell you what though, I'll write to the Cannon Engineer requesting him to sell you one. He controls production of the cannons.
1	line	Captain Lawgof	He won't be able to give you one, but for the right price, I'm sure he'll sell one to you.
1	line	Player	Hmmm... sounds interesting, I might take you up on that.
